el",".py"," (","Scenario","Definition","),"," runtime",".py"," (","Scenario","Runtime","),"," tool","_al","ias","/"," (","interface",","," config",","," factory",","," impl","/s","chema","),"," scenario","_g","enerator","/"," (","interface",","," factory",","," loader",","," config",","," action","_p","ool","_re","pository",","," impl","/{","action","_p","ool",",","response",",","sequential",",","loop",",","random",",","record","ed","},"," action","_p","ools","/{","reason","ing","-and","-m","essage",","," tool","},"," templates","/*",".","json",")\n","-"," protocol","/"," —"," interface",","," config",","," registry",","," open","ai",","," anthrop","ic"," adapt","ers","\n","-"," schedule","/"," —"," config",","," controller"," (","TT","FT","/","TP","OT",")\n","-"," server","_c","ore","/"," —"," config",","," server",".py"," (","Local","M","aa","SS","erver"," base"," +"," Scenario","Re","play","Server","/","Transport","Server","/","Scenario","Record","Server","),"," application",".py"," (","Local","M","aaS","Application",","," Local","M","aa","ST","rans","port","Application"," is"," in"," transport","),"," api","_end","points",".py",","," errors",".py",","," connection","/{","interface",","," factory",","," manager",","," http","/{","config",",","handler",",","server","},"," https","/{","config",",","server",",c","ert","ificate","}}\n","-"," transport","/"," —"," config",","," application"," (","Local","M","aa","ST","rans","port","Application","),"," upstream","_res","olver",","," pr","uner",","," upstream","/{","base",","," open","ai","}\n","-"," record","/"," —"," application",","," config",","," session",","," store",","," parser","\n","-"," utils","/"," —"," json"," (","St","rict","Json","Decoder","),"," lifecycle"," (","Exit","Signal","Wa","iter","),"," logging"," (","Start","up","Logger",","," Request","Logger",")\n","-"," test","/"," —"," e","2","e","_s","upport",","," run","_record","_e","2","e",","," run","_real","_","agent","_record","\n","-"," recordings","/"," —"," cache"," file","\n","-"," docs","/"," —"," architecture",","," https",","," protocol","-","adapt","ers",","," record","-mode",","," response","-s","cheduling",","," scenario","-","format","\n","-"," READ","ME",".md","\n\n","Now"," produce"," a"," concise"," summary"," in"," Chinese"," (","user"," wrote"," in"," Chinese",")."," Keep"," it"," structured","."," The"," user"," asked"," for"," an"," analysis"," of"," the"," structure"," and"," a"," summary"," output","."," This"," is"," a"," report"," task",","," so"," a"," longer"," response"," is"," warranted"," despite"," the"," brev","ity"," guidance"," (","user"," asked"," for"," a"," summary","/d","et","ailed"," analysis",")."]},{"type":"message","text":"# `tests/v2/common` 结构分析\n\n一个 V2 回归测试框架的**公共支撑层**，按“契约层 → 编排层 → 支撑能力 → 测试套件”分层。顶层无 `__init__.py`（作为 namespace package），所有代码通过 `tests.v2.common.*` 导入。\n\n## 顶层文件（4 个能力模块）\n\n| 文件 | 职责 |\n|---|---|\n| `actrail_runtime.py` | 封装 `actraild/actrailctl/actrailviewer` 三个 release 二进制：`init/start/stop/clean` 生命周期、`CommandResult`、隔离 workdir 的 TOML 配置补丁生成（`write_isolated_operator_config_patch`，覆盖 control/socket/pid/storage/payload.tls/plugins/cluster 等配置节） |\n| `agent_selection.py` | 真实 Agent 选择：`AgentSelector` 按 xiaoo→pi→opencode→claude→codex 顺序，`AgentSelection.command()` 生成各 CLI 的调用命令 |\n| `llm_trace_assertion.py` | 基于 actrailviewer JSON 的 trace 断言：trace id、call/request/response 一一配对、payload 完整性、marker 交换校验 |\n| `plugin_web_api.py` | `PluginWebApi`：curl 驱动的 actrailweb 控制面 JSON 客户端（catalog/load/config/validate/unload/command） |\n| `plugin_test_environment.py` | `PluginTestEnvironment`：actraild + actrailweb + runtime-plugin 的完整生命周期（prepare/load/update config/cleanup） |\n\n## 子包\n\n- **`core/`** — 无依赖的契约层（用例与 runner 的公共底座）。`test_case.py`（`TestCase` 抽象类 + `TestCaseMeta` 注册表 + `TestStatus/TestResult`）、`config.py`（`CommonTestConfig`/`TestCaseInputs`）、`output.py`（`TestOutput` 终端输出 + `CaseProgressReporter` 进度路由）、`errors.py`。明确注释\"nothing here imports the runner\"。\n- **`runner/`** — 高层编排。`run.py`（`TestDefinition`、`run_one/run_selected`、`add_common_arguments`、root 校验、依赖跳过、cleanup）、`testing_context.py`（`TestingContextSingleton`：文件锁 + 进程内 lease、`prepare_release` 调用 `scripts/install-release.sh`、output/progress scope 栈）、`environment_probe.py`（主机环境摘要）。\n- **`testing_env/`** — Agent 环境探测。`agent_discovery.py`（`AgentBinaryDiscovery`：env var→PATH→home bin 目录解析，适配 sudo root 场景）、`agent_availability.py`（`AgentAvailability`：对 6 种 agent 做真实探测并缓存）。\n- **`mcp_test_support/`** — MCP 断言支撑。`probe.py`（`McpProbeSpec/McpProbeWorkspace`、stdio 捕获 ABI 边界 4095B）、`action_contract.py`（`McpActionContract` 属性/引用断言）、`assertion.py`（`McpTraceAssertion` 校验 tool_call→request/response→stdin/stdout 图及 payload）。\n- **`utils/`** — `terminal.py`（`colorize`）。\n- **`test_case/`** — 空目录（仅 `__pycache__`，可能是占位）。\n- **`kata_runtime/`** — Kata 虚拟机回归支撑，规模较大：`image/container/guest/process/capabilities/requirements/artifacts/checksums/backend/environment/factory/runtime_config` 十来个模块，并内嵌同名 `test_*.py` 单元测试。\n- **`test_suite_tools/mcp/mcp_probe_server.py`** — 可执行脚本：仓库自有的 stdio MCP 探针服务（JSON-RPC，记录事件日志）。\n- **`test_suites/`** — 两个测试套件：\n  - **`container-manager/`**（3 文件）— docker 测试容器：`ContainerRequest`/`ContainerImage`/`TestContainer`（run/exec/pid namespace/清理）。\n  - **`local_maas_server/`** — 最大的组件，一个**纯标准库的本地 MaaS（LLM）假服务器**，有独立 README 和 6 篇 docs。\n\n## local_maas_server（子服务）结构\n\n```\nserver.py          进程入口（--mode: replay/transport/record）\nconfig.py          LocalMaaSConfig 聚合 + argparse 全量 CLI\nscenario/          剧本模型 + 播放 runtime\n  ├─ tool_alias/       工具/参数 schema 别名转换（impl/schema.py）\n  └─ scenario_generator/  generator 工厂/加载器/action_pool 仓库\n       ├─ impl/          response/sequential/loop/random/action_pool/recorded\n       ├─ action_pools/  reasoning-and-message/ + tool/ 可复用池\n       └─ templates/     6 个 JSON 剧本模板 + action-pools/ 子模板\nprotocol/          协议 adapter + registry（openai.py / anthropic.py）\nschedule/          TTFT/TPOT 响应节奏控制器\nserver_core/       LocalMaaSServer 基类 + 三种 server 子类 + application\n  └─ connection/      http/ + https/（临时证书）+ 连接工厂/管理\ntransport/         LLM 透明代理（upstream 解析/裁剪/upstream openai 客户端）\nrecord/            录制模式（session/store/parser）\nutils/             StrictJsonDecoder / ExitSignalWaiter / 日志\ntest/              录制 E2E 脚本（e2e_support / run_record_e2e / run_real_agent_record）\nrecordings/        *.cache.jsonl 录制缓存数据\ndocs/              architecture / https / scenario-format / protocol-adapters /\n                   response-scheduling / record-mode\n```\n\n## 关键设计要点\n\n- **分层解耦**：`core` 是唯一无外部依赖的契约层；`runner` 依赖 `core`；具体能力模块（MCP/kata/agent）供各回归 case 复用。\n- **真实 agent 回归**：`agent_selection` + `testing_env` 负责挑选可用 agent 二进制，`actrail_runtime` + `llm_trace_assertion` / `mcp_test_support` 用 actrailviewer JSON 做严格的 trace 语义断言。\n- **假 LLM 服务器**：local_maas_server 用 JSON 剧本惰性生成协议无关响应，再经协议 adapter 转成 OpenAI/Anthropic 真实协议；支持 HTTP/HTTPS、direct/SSE、录制回放，专门用于无真实 MaaS 依赖的确定性测试。"}],"stop":"complete","usage":{"output_tokens":3081},"model":"deepseek-v4-flash"}}
